flavor: ['On the continent of Tazeem, rushing waters plunge through narrow canyons into mist-cloaked lakes.', 'On the volcanic continent of Akoum, bizarre vegetation clusters around gas vents, and jagged mountain peaks rise high into the air.', 'The continent of Guul Draz is a geothermal swampland reeking of heat and decay.', 'The continent of Murasa lies beneath a blanket of dense vegetation, its enormous branches tangled so thickly that some inhabitants never see the ground.', 'The continent of Ondu is a vast plateau crisscrossed by deep trenches and meandering rivers.']
